      "description": "Frosted, inset nav bar with logo, wordmark and links.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><span class=\"ds-brand\"><svg viewBox=\"0 10 200 200\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"oklch(0.48 0.19 260)\"><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"110\" r=\"85\" stroke-width=\"14\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"142\" r=\"53\" stroke-width=\"12\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"160\" r=\"33\" stroke-width=\"11\"/></svg><span><b>Scalable Governance</b><small>Applied research on AI governance</small></span></span><span class=\"ds-links\"><a href=\"#\">Mission</a><a href=\"#\">Research</a><a href=\"#\">Contact</a></span></nav>",
